# Keep the docker build context small and deterministic.

# Never ship secrets into the build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local build outputs — must always be built fresh inside the container.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/out

# TypeScript incremental caches — must NEVER enter the container. If they
# do, tsc --incremental treats the prior build state as authoritative and
# skips emitting to outDir, which caused CI TS2307 failures on 2026-09-29
# even though @alpha/db and @alpha/types were "building" successfully.
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Git metadata is not needed at build time.
.git
